{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわ/\nななみん & Rottyでーす/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ  Rotty blogでーす/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2013/10/05/3655975/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんから\n握手会やコメントでよく聞かれること〜\nそれは〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『Rottyはサイリウム何色がいいー☆？』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はいっ、とゆう質問ですねん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その質問には ろってぃ-\n『  赤！ 』 と答えています(о´∀`о)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Rotty夢の方で\nもしサイリウムの色迷っている方\nいらっしゃったら 是非 赤色選んでねん(*´ω`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ、赤ぢゃなきゃダメとかぢゃないよ！迷ってたらでいいからねん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃ-『  白  赤  黒  』を愛してる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、私服は モノトーンで\n赤のパンプスとカーディガンやってね\nレッスン着も 赤と白やったから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"車の移動中の格好が・・・・・☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2013/10/05/3655975/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドーーン！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やばぃぃ(；・∀・)\nうっとちー格好。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"移動中だけやでっ、\nまさかこんな格好で外歩いてないよ！\n電車とかでは 普通にモノトーンやったからね(*´ω｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぱしゃり。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2013/10/05/3655975/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほぃなら